\begin{tightitem}
\item No read up (ss-property): $s$ may read $o$ iff $f_o(o) \sqsubseteq f_s(s)$.
\item No write down ($*$-property): $s$ may write $o$ iff $f_c(s) \sqsubseteq f_o(o)$.
\item Append (write-only) needs only the $*$-property; if the model says write implies read, a write needs both rules.
\end{tightitem}

For each (subject, object, mode) triple evaluate the two components of dominance \emph{separately}:
\begin{tightitem}
\item read: test $f_o(o) \sqsubseteq f_s(s)$;
\item write/append: test $f_c(s) \sqsubseteq f_o(o)$;
\item compare levels with $\leq$ and compartments with $\subseteq$; both must hold.
\end{tightitem}
